  aciklama:
  - "Do\u011Fru cevap \"Matematik\xE7i\" olacakt\u0131 {{isim}}.|4|11 Ekim 1910 y\u0131l\u0131nda
    Selanik'te do\u011Fan, 26 Aral\u0131k 1997 y\u0131l\u0131nda \u0130stanbul'da
    vefat eden T\xFCrk matematik\xE7i Cahit Arf, T\xDCB\u0130TAK Bilim Kolu eski
    ba\u015Fkan\u0131d\u0131r. Cebir konusundaki \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmalar\u0131yla
    d\xFCnyaca \xFCn kazanm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r. Sentetik geometri problemlerinin
    cetvel ve pergel yard\u0131m\u0131yla \xE7\xF6z\xFClebilirli\u011Fi konusunda
    yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131 \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmalar, cisimlerin kuadratik formlar\u0131n\u0131n
    s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131r\u0131lmas\u0131nda ortaya \xE7\u0131kan de\u011Fi\u015Fmezlere
    ili\u015Fkin Arf de\u011Fi\u015Fmezi ve Arf halkalar\u0131 gibi literat\xFCrde
    ad\u0131yla an\u0131lan \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmalar\u0131n yan\u0131 s\u0131ra \"Hasse-Arf
    Teoremi\" ad\u0131 ile an\u0131lan teoremi matematik bilimine kazand\u0131rm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r."
